:: Event - Medicine mob - lost [Place]
<h1 class="ptitle"><<=$game.cabinName ?? ''>></h1>
<br />

<center>
	<<image 'places/cabin/medicine_mob_lost.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

They pushed past you faster than you expected. Desperation makes people reckless.

<br /><br />

<<set _mmlAmount = Math.min(2, setup.cabinInventory.count('antibiotics'))>>
<<if _mmlAmount>>
	<<run setup.cabinInventory.drop('antibiotics', _mmlAmount)>>
	<strong><<= _mmlAmount>> antibiotics taken.</strong>
	<br /><br />
<<else>>
	They tore the place apart looking for medicine and found none. At least that part didn't go to waste.
	<br /><br />
<</if>>

By the time you got back on your feet, they were already gone.

<br /><br />

<<link 'Get up'>>
	<<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
<</link>>
